WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:06.740
Satoshi, Go, and Koharu traveled to
the Crown Snowfield for Pokémon research.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:15.580
Meanwhile, Lilie, Gladio, and Lusamine
found Professor Mohn, their missing father.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:21.500
However, he had lost his memory
and believed that Utsuroid was his daughter, Lilie.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.300
But when his family’s feelings
managed to make him recall his real memories,

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.430
Utsuroid became a new member
of their family.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.100
And now...

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.060
That’s Alola!

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.860
Satoshi and his friends are headed
for the Alola Region with Mohn’s family.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.860
This is making me
a little nervous.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.740
You haven’t been to Alola before,
have you, Koharu?

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.200
Don’t worry.
Everyone’s really nice there!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.790
I want to ask your friend
all about Eevee!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:52.240
Everyone!
Today is a most joyous day...

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:55.950
...for Mohn has returned to Alola!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.240
<i>Glad you’re safe!</i>

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.870
Welcome back home!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:02:59.870
Lilie!

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:00.990
Welcome back!

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.410
Mao! Suiren! Māmane!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.960
I’m back!

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.170
We’ve missed you!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:07.380
Yeah!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.130
You really did it, Lilie!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:23.140
I am so glad to see you again!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.850
Master! Madame!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:26.940
James...

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.020
I am glad you came back
safe and sound...

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:35.030
We’ve been waiting for you
to return for so long!

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.280
Sauboh, Wicke...

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.780
I’m sorry for making you
worry about me.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.200
Professor!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.370
Professor Mohn!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.880
I am a researcher for Aether Paradise!
Rotom, Pokédex Forme-roto!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.710
Pleasuroto to meet you!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.630
Pleasuroto’s all mine, Rotom.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:56.670
Now, let us begin the feast!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.630
All right, everyone...

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.550
...come on out!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.230
Wow, this is amazing!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.810
It’s incredible!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.440
It really is...

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.990
Have as much as you want!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.630
Um, Suiren...

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.800
It’s Koharu, right?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.010
With the Eevee.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:40.890
Yeah!

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:43.890
You see...

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:47.640
I wanted to ask if you could
tell me about your Eevee.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.810
Sure!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:55.150
Hey, Suiren.
What are you going to evolve Sandy into?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.570
Evolve?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:01.740
Eevee and I have come across
lots of her evolutions.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.580
But I still don’t know...

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:09.910
...which of the eight
Eevee wants to evolve into.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.090
One more choice.
The Eevee path.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:14.670
Huh?

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.090
Staying an Eevee.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.760
Like Satoshi’s Pikachu.

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:22.930
Satoshi’s Pikachu?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:29.270
I get it!
So Eevee have nine paths, not just eight!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:32.060
Lots of possibilities!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.480
Lots of...
Possibilities!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.570
Yeah!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.070
Hey, where’s Kaki?

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.120
Oh, about that...

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:47.740
The moment we told him Satoshi
was coming back with Lilie...

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.250
What?! Satoshi?!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.290
There’s no time to waste!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.370
Let’s go, Lizardon!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.420
Hold on, Kaki!

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:56.880
“Go”? Where are you going?

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:00.010
To seclude myself
in Wela Volcano and train!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.380
That’s just like him.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.470
I wanna battle Kaki, too!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.600
Satoshi, you were marvelous
in your promotion match!

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.560
Huh?

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.060
You saw that, Lilie?

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.020
Yes!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.440
I watched an online stream
with Big Brother!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.190
We saw it, too!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.030
Everyone gathered at the Pokémon School
to cheer you on!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:26.450
After all, you’re the first
Alola League Champion!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:28.330
Thanks!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.710
Champion Dande is taking part in
the Masters Tournament too, right?

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:33.960
Yeah!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.920
Beating Mr. Dande
is my goal now!

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.420
Classic Satoshi!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.670
Go for it!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.470
I will cheer for you!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.480
We need to get training, too.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:05.240
A Battle Royal?!

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.110
Yeah!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.320
Dah!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.580
Ooh!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:11.580
Were you copying
your big bro Satoshi?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.960
Lei’s so cute!

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:16.460
Um, what’s a Battle Royal?

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:20.590
It’s a type of Pokémon battle
held at Alola’s Royal Dome.

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.590
Four teams of competitors
clash and battle, all at the same time.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.300
Who am I fighting?

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.300
That’s a secret until the day.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.810
Wha...? No way...

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.350
Well, I’ll tell you <i>one</i> opponent.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.020
Yeah, yeah!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.390
It’s me!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.230
Professor?!

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.230
All right!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.650
You gotta battle as Royal Mask!

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:42.190
Huh?!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.690
Okay? Royal Mask!

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.660
Enjoy!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.240
That’s...

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.080
...Royal Mask?

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.120
That was cool!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.580
But you see, Satoshi...

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.880
...I won’t be wearing my mask.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:03.840
Huh?!

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:07.800
You’re the star of this battle!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.300
The star?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.640
You’re Alola’s Champion!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.560
So I’ll battle you as myself.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.100
Okay?

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.430
Got it.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:19.150
All right!
Time to get training!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.210
I made it in time.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.300
The dome is packed!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:54.390
This is the triumphant return of
the Champion of Alola, after all!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:55.850
Excitement rising!

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:58.270
It’s starting!

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:01.270
Everybody, say Alola!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.150
<i>Alola!</i>

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.020
Put some more energy into it!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.900
<i>Alola!</i>

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.400
Put some more passion into it!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.700
<i>Alola!</i>

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:14.160
This is what you always wanted,
right, me?

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.910
This is the stuff!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:24.670
Thank you all for coming to the
First Alola League Champion Homecoming Battle Royale!

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:31.550
Your emcees today will be the passionate adorer
of Royal Mask and Battle Royals, Sauboh...

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.970
...together with me, Wicke!

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:39.180
And now...
Let’s welcome the competitors!

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.890
The first one in the ring is,
naturally...

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:46.570
...a trainer set to compete in the Masters Tournament
to determine the strongest in the world!

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:52.530
It is our Champion,
Competitor Satoshi with Pikachu!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.070
Let’s do our best, Pikachu!

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.200
And for the next corner...

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.540
The founder of
the Alola Pokémon League!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.840
Competitor Kukui with Gaogaen!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.550
Next up, in the third corner...

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:15.510
Akala Island’s blazing
Island King in the making!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:18.350
Competitor Kaki with Garagara!

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:21.270
And last but not least!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.690
The Alola League runner-up!

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.480
Competitor Gladio with...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.150
...Lilie the Utsuroid!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.490
<i>Lilie?!</i>

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:35.490
Yes!
The newest member of my family.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:37.200
Huh...

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:41.000
Cool! Ultra Beast Lilie!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.540
Lugarugan! Stone Edge!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.460
Zoroark! Night Burst!

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:04.690
Lilie...

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.900
You want to battle?

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.990
Let’s show them
the fruits of our training!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.110
Battling with Utsuroid
right out the gate, huh?

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:23.370
We have truly marvelous
competitors here today!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.170
Well then, let the Battle Royal...

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:27.830
...begin!

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:35.420
Pikachu!
Use Iron Tail on Gaogaen!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.760
Gaogaen! Build Up!

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:44.140
As usual, a calm and composed choice from Royal Ma—
I mean, Competitor Kukui!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.100
Garagara, use Iron Head!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.980
Lilie! Venom Shock!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.690
Gaogaen! DD Lariat!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.450
Pikachu!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:16.630
Pikachu!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.560
Is it just me,
or are they <i>only</i> targeting Pikachu?

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.810
So this is a Battle Royal...

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:29.810
A cutthroat battle
where anyone can attack anyone.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.060
That’s what a Battle Royal is!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.980
Lilie! Meteor Beam!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.070
Garagara, use Flare Drive!

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.070
Gaogaen! DD Lariat!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.620
Pikachu!
Dodge them with Lightning Speed!

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.870
<i>He’s fast!</i>

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:52.880
Shadow Bone!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:53.840
Psycho Shock!

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:54.630
Build Up!

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:06.720
Gaogaen, stop Pikachu!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.640
Iron Tail!

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:15.520
Gaogaen lost its balance!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.980
Pikachu, you’re amazing!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.370
You’ve gotten even stronger,
haven’t you, Satoshi?!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.370
I’ve been training every day
so I can beat Mr. Dande!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.370
You’re...

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.040
...not the only one...

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.000
...who’s been training!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.710
Garagara! Shadow Bone!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.550
Lilie! Venom Shock!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.220
Gaogaen! Blast Burn!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:46.100
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.480
Now! Electroweb!

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:56.480
Dodge it!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.650
One more 100,000 Volts!

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.530
Gaogaen, use Hell Thrust!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.670
Iron Head!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.210
Pummel him with Hell Thrusts!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.800
Counter with Iron Tail!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.300
Meteor Beam!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.680
Good work, Lilie!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.230
Shadow Bone!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.360
I’ll be the one to take down Satoshi!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.690
No, <i>I’m</i> gonna defeat Satoshi!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.780
Lilie, use Venom Shock
on Garagara!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:48.700
Dodge it, Garagara!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.290
Iron Head!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.550
Utsuroid is unable to battle!

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.430
Competitor Gladio
is out of the running!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.020
You did well, Lilie.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.810
Let’s train together some more.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.400
Gladio’s really become
a lot tougher.

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.320
Yes.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.490
He’s just like you
when you were young.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.820
Satoshi!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.200
I’ll use my full power!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.330
Face me with your full power!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.330
Of course!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.790
Let’s do this!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.920
Garagara!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:43.260
My full body...

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:44.970
...soul...

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:46.470
...and power!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:48.720
The zenith of all that I am...

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:52.930
Become a blazing flame that burns
like the mountain of Akala!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:16:02.770
Dynamic Full Flame!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:04.610
Use 100,000 Volts to dodge it!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:10.870
Now!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:22.880
He dodged the Z-Move!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.630
That was great, Pikachu!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:30.510
And that’s what makes you my rival,
Satoshi!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.640
You don’t have time
to stand around!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.560
Gaogaen, use DD Lariat!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.150
Lightning Speed!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.190
Shadow Bone!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:55.950
Garagara is unable to battle!
Competitor Kaki is out of the running!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.460
Thanks.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.670
That was a good battle.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.550
Don’t let your guard down, Pikachu!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.730
Doesn’t this take you back,
Satoshi?

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:24.980
Yeah!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:18:03.850
Champion! Champion! Champion!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:07.110
<i>Champion! Champion!</i>

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.320
Everyone’s cheering for
Satoshi and Pikachu...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:12.240
He’s a celebrity!

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.990
Go for it, first-ever
Champion of the Alola League!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.620
Our Champion!
You’ve gotta win this!

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.620
Champion! Champion!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.040
Go for it!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:24.420
Never forget
you’re representing Alola!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:26.880
Everyone’s cheering for you!

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.130
Everyone...

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.380
Bring home the win, Satoshi!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.890
In the Masters Tournament!

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.890
Kaki... Gladio...

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.890
Use your full power!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:49.900
Pikachu.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.160
All right!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.410
Here we go, Pikachu!

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.410
Is this it?

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:05.870
Gaogaen!

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:19.760
Burn with passion, Gaogaen!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:24.430
Set the ring ablaze
with the flames of victory!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.810
Far greater than 100,000 Volts...
1,000,000 Volts!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:36.450
No, way, <i>way</i> greater than that!
Our super full power!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.240
Hyper Dark Crusher!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.790
Pikachu!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:47.250
10,000,000 Volts!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.490
Thought I’d find you here.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:24.240
Professor! Alola!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.250
Alola.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.790
What’s on your mind?

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.250
Just...
I’m glad I came.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.720
To Alola.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.760
I see.

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.020
Kapu-Kokeko?!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.580
Kapu-Kokeko is praying
for your victory.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:18.130
I’ll do my best
in the Masters Tournament!

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.520
His family in Alola...

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.310
Alola’s people and Pokémon...

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.480
Its scenery...

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.730
Its battles...

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:35.730
And Kapu-Kokeko,
the guardian deity...

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:40.490
...are all pushing Satoshi forward
as he heads toward the Masters Tournament.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.620
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:10.870
Go!

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:13.200
Finally, the last mission!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.870
Let’s hurry there, Go!

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:15.870
No.

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:17.420
I’m going alone this time.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:19.250
Wha—?! How come?!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:20.250
Shigeru?!

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.550
I never imagined we’d someday
end up walking together.

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:25.430
Layla and Shun'ya...!

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:27.390
Shigeru, let’s work together!

00:23:27.390 --> 00:23:29.430
I’ve been waiting for you
to say that!

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.430
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:35.440
The Last Mission!
Catch Regieleki and Regidrago!!
